cases.purpose:
Streaming baseline: canned 3-chunk SSE (role delta / content delta / finish stop; NO [DONE] frame) -> full Anthropic event sequence message_start..message_stop with exact JSON fields and framing 'event: X
data: {...}

'. message_start.usage.input_tokens is a LOCAL o200k_base estimate over the client request (expected 3). Upstream body gains stream_options.include_usage:true; upstream headers gain Accept: text/event-stream + Cache-Control: no-cache. Clean EOF without [DONE] still produces message_delta + message_stop (synthesized [DONE]).

